# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository and on checkout.
#
# Without this, a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true checks files out with CRLF,
# which makes `npm run format:check` fail locally on every file even though the
# committed content is already correctly formatted (Prettier expects LF).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
